# Paldex agent routing

Product is **Paldex** (toolkit: tiers, breeding, teams, Paldeck, map) — not an achievement tracker. Prefer `paldex-product` over legacy tracker skills.

## Growth / SEO loop

1. **Execute:** use skill `paldex-growth` + `.cursor/plans/growth-backlog.md`
2. **Review SEO batches:** use skill `paldex-seo-review` (review only; return FAIL → growth fixes)
3. Do not mark SEO backlog items `done` until review is PASS (or user overrides)

## Approval

New features, new routes, ads wiring, map layers/modes, and commits/PRs need **explicit user approval**. SEO polish on existing pages (meta, FAQ, JSON-LD, cross-links, shareable query params) may proceed without asking.
